heater-batteries is required at plant 
handover: 
a. the size of the battery, number of 
passes and fin spacing; 
b. the design flow and return 
temperatures and flow rate in L/s; 
c. the pressure drop across the water 
side of the battery in Pa; 
d. the number of phases, supply 
voltage, current drawn and number 
of steps if electric; 
